lator/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/deployments","created_at":"2026-01-25T12:55:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T21:48:29Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-08T05:22:03Z","git_url":"git://github.com/link-assistant/calculator.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:link-assistant/calculator.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/calculator.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/calculator","homepage":"https://link-assistant.github.io/calculator/","size":46805,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":22,"license":{"key":"unlicense","name":"The Unlicense","spdx_id":"Unlicense","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/unlicense","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE1"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":1,"open_issues":22,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/pulls/228","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/calculator/pull/228","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/calculator/pull/228.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/calculator/pull/228.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes #227\n\n## Summary\n\nDeep case study of how far this calculator is from \"every competitor plus scientific prose in any language\", with executable corpora, an automated gap checker, and the full work plan filed as 18 sub-issues (#229 to #246) with GitHub blocker dependencies.\n\n- `scripts/competitor-coverage.mjs` runs every corpus row through the one-shot CLI and classifies it as `supported`, `different`, `unsupported` or `timeout`; writes `results/coverage-report.md` and a compact `coverage-baseline.json`; `--baseline` fails on regressions. Unit-tested by `scripts/competitor-coverage.test.mjs` (runs in the existing `node --test scripts/*.test.mjs` CI step).\n- `scripts/import-competitor-corpus.mjs` extracts single-expression assertions from the fend, libqalculate, Numbat, Rink and math.js test suites (2550 rows, upstream licenses cited in the file header).\n- `docs/case-studies/issue-227/`: README with requirement inventory, method, measurements, error classes, solution options, component evaluation and dependency graph; `competitor-inventory.md`; `natural-language-corpus.md`; three corpora (3055 rows); the generated report and baseline; the 18 sub-issue bodies exactly as filed plus `issues.json`.\n\n## Measured state (v0.22.0, 3055 rows, 24 s)\n\n| Source | Rows | Supported | Different | Unsupported |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| fend | 1098 | 33.6% | 67 | 662 |\n| Qalculate! | 656 | 9.3% | 14 | 581 |\n| math.js | 297 | 26.9% | 22 | 195 |\n| Numbat | 289 | 22.5% | 22 | 202 |\n| Rink | 210 | 0.0% | 33 | 177 |\n| Soulver docs | 266 | 9.4% | 32 | 209 |\n| Numi, Wolfram\\|Alpha, Google, Calca, Raycast, Apple, Frink | 77 | 39.0% | 3 | 44 |\n| Scientific quotes in 13 languages | 162 | 6.2% | 20 | 132 |\n| **All** | **3055** | **20.9%** | **213** | **2202** |\n\nMost important finding: 213 rows return a silently wrong number, for example `3,000 minus 12` gives `-9`, `200 + 10%` gives `200.1`, `10m × 10m` gives `0.0001`, `3 squared plus 4 squared` gives `7 squared`, `5pm - 7pm` gives `-2 hours`, `0xff` gives `0 XFF`.\n\n## Sub-issues created\n\n| # | Title | Blocked by |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| #229 | Run the competitor coverage checker in CI and fail on regressions | none |\n| #230 | Keep the imported open-source test suites current and add missing engines | none |\n| #231 | Complete the closed-source documentation corpus | none |\n| #232 | Grow the multilingual scientific-quote corpus | none |\n| #233 | Thousands separators and locale decimal commas give silently wrong answers | #229 |\n| #234 | Percent arithmetic differs from every competitor | #229 |\n| #235 | General dimensional unit algebra | #229, #233 |\n| #236 | Scientific notation as written in papers | #233, #235 |\n| #237 | English noun-phrase operators | #229 |\n| #238 | Multilingual phrase operators, spelled numbers, CJK tokenization | #237, #233, #236 |\n| #239 | Number bases, bitwise, repeating decimals, display formats | #229 |\n| #240 | Complex numbers, vectors/matrices, infinity/NaN, special functions | #229, #239 |\n| #241 | Symbolic algebra | #240 |\n| #242 | Notepad state, booleans, strings, comments, conditionals | #229 |\n| #243 | Date and time parity | #229 |\n| #244 | Finance, statistics and rate phrases | #234, #235, #237 |\n| #245 | LaTeX, MathML and Unicode math input | #236, #242 |\n| #246 | Milestone: every corpus row supported or documented | #230 to #245 |\n\nAll are attached as sub-issues of #227 through the sub-issues API; the 37 blocker edges are registered through the issue-dependencies API (`experiments/issue-227/create-sub-issues.mjs`, idempotent).\n\n## How to reproduce\n\n```sh\ncargo build --release --bin link-calculator\nnode scripts/competitor-coverage.mjs --baseline docs/case-studies/issue-227/results/coverage-baseline.json\nnode --test scripts/*.test.mjs\n```\n\nThe runner prints the per-source table and `No regressions against …`; the full row-level report is regenerated at `docs/case-studies/issue-227/results/coverage-report.md`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No Rust code changes; `cargo fmt --check`, `node scripts/check-file-size.mjs` and the script tests pass locally.\n- `coverage-results.json` (1 MB, full row output) is gitignored; the committed baseline is the compact per-row status.\n- Upstream test data is used as an executable reference under the quoted licenses and is not relicensed.\n- Assumptions are listed at the end of the case-study README (how \"beat exactly\" is measured, live-data rows only have to evaluate, conflicting competitor conventions are resolved per sub-issue).\n- The 18 sub-issues (#229 to #246) are the work plan filed by this PR; they stay open after merge and are not closed by it. Only #227 is closed here.\n- Web dependencies are bumped to their latest releases (vite, @vitejs/plugin-react, jsdom, react-i18next, links-notation, lino-objects-codec, browser-commander) because the Dependency Freshness job fails on any release published after `main` last passed; the 229 web unit tests and `tsc` pass with the new versions.\n\n<!-- hive-mind:changes:start -->\n### Changes\n- 37 file(s) modified\n- 11258 line(s) added\n- 93 line(s) removed\n- Files:\n  - `.gitignore`\n  - `changelog.d/20261007_120000_competitor_coverage_corpus.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/README.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/competitor-inventory.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/corpus/closed-source-docs.tsv`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/corpus/natural-language-quotes.tsv`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/corpus/open-source-tests.tsv`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/issue.json`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/natural-language-corpus.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/results/coverage-baseline.json`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/results/coverage-report.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/01-coverage-gate-in-ci.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/02-open-source-suite-import.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/03-closed-source-docs-corpus.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/04-multilingual-scientific-quote-corpus.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/05-thousands-separators-locale-decimals.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/06-percent-semantics-parity.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/07-dimensional-unit-algebra.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/08-si-prefixes-superscripts-uncertainty-scale-words.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/09-english-phrase-operators.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/10-multilingual-phrase-operators-and-numbers.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/11-number-bases-bitwise-fraction-and-display-formats.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/12-complex-numbers-vectors-matrices-special-values.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/13-symbolic-algebra-equations.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/14-notepad-state-booleans-strings-comments.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/15-dates-timezones-relative-calendar.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/16-finance-statistics-rates.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/17-latex-mathml-unicode-math-input.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/18-parity-milestone.md`\n  - `docs/case-studies/issue-227/sub-issues/issues.json`\n  - `experiments/issue-227/create-sub-issues.mjs`\n  - `experiments/issue-227/extract-soulver-examples.mjs`\n  - `scripts/competitor-coverage.mjs`\n  - `scripts/competitor-coverage.test.mjs`\n  - `scripts/import-competitor-corpus.mjs`\n  - `web/package-lock.json`\n  - `web/package.json`\n<!-- hive-mind:changes:end -->\n\nFixes #229\nFixes #230\nFixes #231\nFixes #232\nFixes #233\nFixes #234\nFixes #235\nFixes #236\nFixes #237\nFixes #238\nFixes #239\nFixes #240\nFixes #241\nFixes #242\nFixes #243\nFixes #244\nFixes #245\nFixes #246\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/issues/228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/issues/228/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]